@startuml seq-recommandations-ia
title Diagramme de séquence -- Recommandations IA (RAG hybride pgvector)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor       #2C5282
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C5282
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor    #2C5282
    ActorBackgroundColor      #FAFAFA
    ActorBorderColor          #2C5282
}

actor "Installateur"                  as User
participant "Frontend"                as FE
participant "API Gateway"             as GW
participant "DecisionSupportService"  as DSS
participant "EquipmentSelectionService\n+ CompatibilityRuleEngine" as ESV
participant "EmbeddingService\n(Ollama nomic-embed-text)" as ES
database    "PostgreSQL\n+ pgvector"  as PG
participant "Ollama LLM\n(local:11434)" as LLM

User -> FE  : Cliquer « Recommandations IA »
FE   -> GW  : POST /api/dimensioning/{id}/ai/regenerate (JWT)
GW   -> DSS : Forward

DSS  -> ESV : Sélection déterministe\n(kWc, monophasé/triphasé)
ESV --> DSS : Onduleur Solax/Sungrow\n+ câbles + disjoncteurs Schneider\n+ score / verdict

DSS  -> ES  : embed(\"installation 5 kWc\nmonophasé Tunis ...\")
ES  --> DSS : vector[768]

DSS  -> PG  : SELECT content, metadata\nORDER BY embedding <=> $1\nLIMIT 5
PG  --> DSS : Top-K chunks\n(catalogue société, NFC 33-209,\nSTEG/ANME)

DSS  -> LLM : POST /api/generate\n(prompt = kit + chunks + JSON schema)
LLM --> DSS : JSON {alerts, clientArguments,\nterrainChecklist, narrative}

DSS  -> DSS : Fusion verdict déterministe\n+ enrichissement LLM
DSS --> GW  : 200 OK + InstallerRecommendationDto
GW  --> FE  : 200 + JSON structuré
FE  --> User : Afficher kit, score,\nalertes, arguments client

alt Ollama indisponible
    LLM --> DSS : timeout / erreur
    DSS --> GW  : 200 OK\n(fallback déterministe, fallback=true)
    GW  --> FE  : 200 + kit sans narratif IA
    FE  --> User : Afficher kit + bandeau\n« Mode hors-ligne »
end

@enduml
